{
  "id": "ch02_s26_shuge",
  "chapter": 2,
  "act": 2,
  "scene": "shuge",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "liuchenghuan"
  ],
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [
    "liuchenghuan"
  ],
  "purpose": "主角确实为她的照顾心动，也看见没有说出的自己",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "名册的两行字已经读过，你在柳的杯边坐下。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l2",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "柳把杯子转了半圈，杯沿缺口朝向自己。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l3",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这里不烫，拿这里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l4",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你接住她留下的半边杯沿，暖意贴着掌心，手指一根根松开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l5",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "正好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l6",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你喝慢些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l7",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她把一小卷干布塞到你的腕下，杯子还端着，手已经不用悬着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l8",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你怎么连这个都……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l9",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你总换手。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l10",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你低头试了试，手腕搁稳了。方才卡在喉头的一口气吐出来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l11",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "承欢。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l12",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "嗯？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l13",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "再坐近些。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l14",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把膝边的书往里挪。她坐过来，裙角铺到那一小块亮处。",
      "image": "liuchenghuan_2_jinzuo"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l15",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "她低头看你杯里的水，颊边一缕头发垂下来，你看了好一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l16",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（她记得我哪只手疼。连我没说的也记得。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l17",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不添了，陪我坐着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l18",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l19",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你喝完这一口，杯子仍搁在布卷上。她没动，你也没去拿书。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l20",
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（今夜都这样就好了。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l21",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "杯底歪了一点。你只动了动腕子，她便伸手扶住。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l22",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你顺着她的手把杯子放稳，笑了。没有说自己也会。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "没去抄试？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "稿送到了，你没误时就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "稿到了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_accept_1": true
      },
      "who": "self",
      "kind": "inner",
      "text": "（我看见那张报名牒了。还是把稿交给了她。）"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l27",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "后来去抄试了么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l28",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "去了，散后还来看看缺不缺人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l29",
      "when": {
        "flag.chenghuan_refuse_1": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "散后……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l30",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你自己喝什么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l31",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "剩下的正好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l32",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不是剩多少，我问——"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l33",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你喜欢哪样，就哪样。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l34",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l35",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我问你，喜欢热的还是放温的？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l36",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你把手从杯边拿开。她跟着去拿壶，以为要添水。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l37",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "阿荻叫我先问，你倒不用我问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l38",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "问……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l39",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "要问的那么多，来这里歇歇。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l40",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l41",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "open",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你要的，就是我要的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l42",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "可你的半日，不是我的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l43",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "guarded",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "……"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l44",
      "who": "liuchenghuan",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "不选我也没关系，在这里就好。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch02_s26_shuge.l45",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "门外有人递来公主的全稿。柳先让开，你没有把自己的杯子放进她手里。"
    }
  ],
  "goto": "ch02_s24_shuge"
}
